cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Feature Treatment and Bootstrap Stability in Clustering Orchard Microclimate Time Series"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and reproducibility package for the study "Feature treatment and
  bootstrap stability in clustering orchard microclimate time series". Aggregates a
  six-month hourly IoT record from a single durian orchard into daily features,
  contrasts a naive feature treatment against a physics-informed one that log-damps
  zero-inflated rain and stress-hour counts, and reports cluster-wise bootstrap
  Jaccard stability, Markov regime dynamics, dry-spell detection and an FAO-56
  vapour-pressure-deficit provenance check.
type: software
